          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "Warnings for Withel terraces were issued on March 14 at 07:22 UTC, followed by evacuations of about 60 households from the terraces beginning at 07:31 UTC.",
